Build instructions for xrdp:

$ git clone https://github.com/neutrinolabs/xrdp
$ patch -p0 -i xrdp-hobart-patch.patch
$ cd xrdp
$ ./bootstrap
$ ./configure --enable-jpeg --host=armv7l-timesys-linux-gnueabi
$ make
$ make install DESTDIR=/home/hobart/xrdp

Zip up 'etc' and 'usr' folders into xrdp_armle.tar.gz (or xrdp_armhf.tar.gz) and check in.
